Notice on the example data

All example data in this repository is fictional. Alice's Law Firm, every
county office, consultant, homeowner, case number, address, phone number and
message in the data files, the gate sheet, the web app and the documents was
made up for this exercise. Any resemblance to a real person, firm or office is
not intended. No real client data is included, and no API key or credential is
included.
